# EXP-33: K-Means Cluster Size Comparison & Visualization in WEKA

======================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 33: K-MEANS CLUSTER SIZE COMPARISON (K = 2, 3, 4, 5) IN WEKA
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE:
   To evaluate the impact of changing cluster size K (2, 3, 4, 5) in WEKA's 
   SimpleKMeans algorithm and visualize cluster boundaries.

2. WEKA ARFF DATASET (employee_clusters_exp33.arff):
----------------------------------------------------------------------
@relation employee_cluster_data

@attribute Salary numeric
@attribute Credit numeric

@data
